{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019140014248-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019141120\"/><p>消防到場破門進入單位。</p><p>沙田發生火警。今午(19日)12時25分，禾輋邨保安報案，指泰和樓一單位冒出濃煙。救援人員接報到場，消防破門進入單位後發現空無一人，相信單位住戶煮食期間離開單位，忘記閂火導致煲燶野引致火警，事件中無人受傷，起火原因無可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:19:05.617610+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:50.874993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:35.731074+00:00","content_hash":"4b4f056dad78e0ad73d668f97c9082fc6f7bf4c312d08e7f07fa59fefb8c7c1d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}